{"id":"666639","name":"酸菜烧鸭血","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/666639/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酸菜","amount":"半棵"},{"name":"鸭血","amount":"600g"}],"sub":[{"name":"五花肉","amount":"三两"},{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"干红辣椒","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"腌制的酸菜。","img":"images/666639/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"酸菜切好。","img":"images/666639/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"挤出多余的水分。","img":"images/666639/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"姜切丝、干红辣椒切段、蒜切片和葱花备用。","img":"images/666639/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"五花肉备用。","img":"images/666639/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸭血洗净备用。","img":"images/666639/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"切成厚点的片。(太薄煮出来就烂了)","img":"images/666639/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"冷水下锅。","img":"images/666639/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放少许白酒，水开，撇去浮沫。","img":"images/666639/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"捞出来，不过凉水，放入盆中，备用。","img":"images/666639/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅烧热放适量油，倒入五花肉炒香，再倒入酸菜，放点耗油，一起炒香，酸菜的酸味炒出来。","img":"images/666639/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再加适量水，放入鸭血。","img":"images/666639/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放少许盐、白胡椒粉和生抽，焖煮三到五分钟。","img":"images/666639/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"调味放入少许生抽和鸡精。","img":"images/666639/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"撒上葱花。","img":"images/666639/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"出锅装盆。","img":"images/666639/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"酸辣开胃。","img":"images/666639/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"下饭菜。","img":"images/666639/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}